  <name>2D Truss Analysis</name>
  <summary>Professional 2D truss structural analysis software</summary>
  
  <description>
    <p>
      2D Truss Analysis is a professional-grade structural analysis application built with modern C++20 and Qt6.
      It features an intuitive interactive drawing interface and robust computational engine for analyzing truss structures.
    </p>
    <p>
      Key features include:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Interactive drawing canvas with mouse-based node and member placement</li>
      <li>Direct stiffness method implementation</li>
      <li>Support for various load types and boundary conditions</li>
      <li>Professional results display with comprehensive tables</li>
      <li>Visual deformation plots and force diagrams</li>
      <li>Material and section property management</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      This tool is invaluable for Civil Engineering students and professionals working with truss structures,
      helping validate manual calculations and providing insights into structural behavior.
    </p>
  </description>
  
